{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for adventure in Realms of Conflict, the ultimate top down, open world indie role playing adventure game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture forth into the world of Artad, a mystical place filled with warring kingdoms of men, dwarves, elves, goblins and more.  Grow your skills and power as you venture into the world, taking jobs, going on quests, finding gear, and fighting terrifying foes.  Unlock new items, skills and abilities as your fame and power grow.  Artad is an open world, so players are free to chart their own quest and set their own destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Open world top-down 3d gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Real time RPG mechanics, questing, leveling up, and combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich and engaging lore, backstory and dialog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play the way you want, with gamepad, keyboard and touchscreen support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sync your progress between devices using a free Ape Apps account (optional)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a peaceful like or join the fight for fame in glory in Realms of Conflict, the ultimate action RPG adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072610?t=1763145550","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072610/63e7f4eb3fea5eccf701db17ea70dc25c72238ae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763145550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072610/0abf3a83cdb45e074892f8490397b620937c6e7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763145550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072610/0abf3a83cdb45e074892f8490397b620937c6e7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763145550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}